:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[The 4th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''The 4th Angel''' is a [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angel]] enemy that appears in the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = The 4th Angel
|image = E 392.png
|appearance = [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has a 100% chance to [[Knockback]] against all Cat Units, this enemy becomes hard to hit with units with long attack animations or units with slow movement speed.

==Strategy==
Not too bad to deal with, although early players could find it annoying to fight. Using [[:Category:Cats with Knockback Immunity|cats with Knockback immunity]] helps significantly against The 4th Angel. Units that attack after a knockback (i.e. [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]], etc.) are also useful.

